{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3014018020020","name":"千雪","text":"（私の残りの魔力は……）","trans":"（我剩下的魔力……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020030","name":"千雪","text":"（……ダメね……この量だと\r\n火は消し止められない……それに──）","trans":"（……不行呢……这个量的话\n灭不掉火……而且——）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"住民１","text":"キャー！","trans":"呀啊——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020050","name":"千雪","text":"光魔法！\r\nライトブレイク！","trans":"光魔法！\n光明破击！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020060","name":"千雪","text":"（みんなを守るために残しておかないと……）","trans":"（得为了守护大家留一些才行……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020071","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"──千雪さん！","trans":"——千雪！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020080","name":"千雪","text":"……！\r\nふたりとも……！","trans":"……！\n你们两个……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020100","name":"千雪","text":"うん、平気……","trans":"嗯，我没事……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020110","name":"甘奈","text":"……けど、だいぶ息上がってる……","trans":"……不过，呼吸挺急促的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020120","name":"甘奈","text":"それに、魔力量だって……","trans":"而且，魔力量也……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020130","name":"千雪","text":"心配しないで\r\nおもちが戻ってきたし、もう大丈夫","trans":"别担心\n麻糬也回来了，已经没事了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020140","name":"千雪","text":"それより\r\nふたりには消火をお願いしていいかな","trans":"比起这个\n灭火的事能拜托你们两个吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020150","name":"千雪","text":"私は回復しながら\r\n町のみんなの安全を確保するから","trans":"我一边恢复\n一边确保镇上大家的安全","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020170","name":"千雪","text":"ごめんね\r\n大変なお願い、しちゃって……","trans":"抱歉啊\n提了这么为难的请求……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020180","name":"甘奈","text":"ううん、千雪さんは","trans":"不用，千雪你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-51","name":"甘奈","text":"ここまでみんなを守ってくれてたんだもん","trans":"一直守护大家到现在的嘛","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020190","name":"甘奈","text":"ここからは\r\n甘奈と甜花ちゃんがやらなくちゃ！","trans":"接下来\n得由甘奈和甜花来做了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020210","name":"甘奈","text":"プリン！","trans":"布丁！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-59","name":"プリン","text":"うん！","trans":"嗯！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020220","name":"甜花","text":"アンニン……！","trans":"杏仁……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-63","name":"プリン＆アンニン","text":"マジックパワー、送信！","trans":"魔法力量，发送！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020230","name":"甘奈","text":"受信！","trans":"接收！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020240","name":"甜花","text":"完了……！","trans":"完成……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020241","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"マジカルフォーム、チェンジ！","trans":"魔法形态，变换！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020250","name":"甘奈","text":"甜花ちゃん、行くよっ！","trans":"甜花，上吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020280","name":"千雪","text":"おもち、お願い","trans":"麻糬，拜托了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-90","name":"おもち","text":"わかったわ\r\n私に任せて","trans":"知道了\n交给我吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020290","name":"甘奈","text":"かなり広がっちゃってる……","trans":"蔓延得挺厉害……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020300","name":"甜花","text":"……け、消せる……\r\nかな……","trans":"……能，能灭掉……\n吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020310","name":"甘奈","text":"バラバラに魔法を使うだけだと\r\n難しいかも……","trans":"光是各自分散使用魔法\n可能有点难……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020320","name":"甘奈","text":"プリン、アンニン\r\n甘奈と甜花ちゃんの魔力、同調させられる？","trans":"布丁，杏仁\n能把甘奈和甜花的魔力同调吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-102","name":"プリン","text":"大丈夫だと思うよっ","trans":"我想可以的哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-103","name":"アンニン","text":"おう、お前たちのは波長が似てるからな\r\nそんなに難しくないと思うぜ","trans":"哦，你们俩的波长很像嘛\n我想不会太难","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020340","name":"甘奈","text":"ふたりの魔力を合わせて\r\nひとつの強力な魔法にするの","trans":"把两个人的魔力合起来\n变成一个强力的魔法","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020350","name":"甘奈","text":"そうすれば、火は消せると思う","trans":"这样的话，应该就能灭火了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-113","name":"アンニン","text":"決まったな！\r\nそれじゃ早速行くぜ！","trans":"就这么定了！\n那马上就上吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-116","name":"プリン＆アンニン","text":"魔力同調、開始","trans":"魔力同调，开始","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020370","name":"甘奈","text":"……！\r\n甜花ちゃん、行くよっ！","trans":"……！\n甜花，上吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020381","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"水魔法──","trans":"水魔法——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020382","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"スプレッドシャワー！","trans":"扩散水花！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020390","name":"甜花","text":"す……すごい……","trans":"好，好厉害……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020400","name":"甜花","text":"これなら……\r\nすぐ、消せそう……！","trans":"这样的话……\n好像马上就能灭掉……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020410","name":"甘奈","text":"うん……！\r\nで、でも……","trans":"嗯……！\n可，可是……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020420","name":"甘奈","text":"ちょっと威力が強すぎるかも……！\r\nこれだと避難してるみんなのところに……","trans":"威力可能有点太强了……！\n这样的话会波及到正在避难的人……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020430","name":"千雪","text":"土魔法──","trans":"土魔法——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020440","name":"千雪","text":"サンドウォール！","trans":"沙之墙！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020441","name":"甘奈＆甜花","text":"千雪さん！","trans":"千雪！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-159","name":"住民２","text":"ありがとう！\r\n魔法警備隊ー！","trans":"谢谢！\n魔法警备队——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-160","name":"住民３","text":"３人がいれば\r\n安心だわ～！","trans":"有3个人在\n就安心了～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020451","name":"一同","text":"えへへ","trans":"欸嘿嘿","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-173","name":"子ども","text":"警備隊さん！\r\nいつものあれ、やってやって～！","trans":"警备队！\n平时那个，来一下嘛来一下嘛～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020460","name":"甘奈","text":"……えへへ\r\nいいよっ！","trans":"……诶嘿嘿\n可以哦！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020470","name":"甜花","text":"町の……\r\n平和は……","trans":"小镇的……\n和平……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020480","name":"千雪","text":"今日も私たち","trans":"今天我们也","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020490","name":"甘奈","text":"魔法警備隊に～","trans":"魔法警备队～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3014018020491","name":"一同","text":"お任せっ！","trans":"交给我们！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}